{"candidateAnswer":"Jewelry made from sea glass and driftwood","evidence":"[D22:5 | 9:41 pm on 6 October, 2023] Audrey: Oh yes! I love making jewelry out of recycled stuff. It's a great way to show my love of creativity and sustainability. I hunt down things like bottle caps, buttons, and broken jewelry, and then turn them into one-of-a-kind pieces. Here's a photo of one of my favorite necklaces. They all hold a special story and have their own appeal. Plus, it's a small step in reducing waste.","itemId":"urn:uuid:4119088d-e8a9-5aa5-a4d0-6028bc24183f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5e893f4feda6e4e05dc87fa34933ec2f5a482ca7beac9f0c57a704734c97434f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of jewelry does Audrey make?","referenceAnswer":"Jewelry made from recycled objects","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5e893f4feda6e4e05dc87fa34933ec2f5a482ca7beac9f0c57a704734c97434f"}}]}